{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "scope": "scsp-synth-one-self-custom-four-six-operator-feedback",
  "baseCommit": "d76285ad9b0eb786ce77cdd77272d5398047d185",
  "review": "One self-feedback OP in Custom4/6 extends the established X32/Y0 owned-history policy without core changes. Complete source bodies and dependencies are pinned; 110 actual Git-predecessor/current cases cover the old66, all sixteen Custom2 self graph/output combinations at both output rates including same-ID retriggers, and six former four/six-OP merge/fanout graphs. PCM, RAM, raw64 sound-stack checkpoints, full registers, write order, state and v4-v8 serialized exports remain exact. Core/SSF WASM, shared runtime, gains, native/vendor files and historical JSON remain unchanged.",
